## 编译 russh
``` bash
git clone git@github.com:zeroleo12345/russh.git

mise use -g rust@1.88

rm -rf target  && cargo build --verbose
```


## 编译 russh-napi
``` bash
yarn install

yarn build --target aarch64-apple-darwin

cp  russh.darwin-arm64.node  ~/github/tabby_project/tabby/app/node_modules/russh/
# 使用 CI package.zip:  xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/github/tabby_project/tabby/app/node_modules/russh
```


## 发布到 npmjs.org: russh-napi
``` bash
npm login

npm whoami

# 从 Github Action 下载 package.zip
jieya package.zip
npm publish ./rustssh2-9.0.0.tgz  --access public     #  npm 会读取 tarball 里的 package/package.json
```


